# Agent ops

## Confirm gates

- Irreversibles need `ยืนยัน` / `confirm` / `yes`: `/feature` (per slice), `/plan run` (per todo), `/ship`, `/upgrades apply` (slash rename or shared REPORT change).
- List **IRREVERSIBLES** before asking. Slash alone ≠ consent → `AWAITING_CONFIRM`.
- Same-message confirm after inspect/plan steps (`/ship ยืนยัน`, `/plan run … ยืนยัน`, `/feature`+confirm) → act **once**.
- Enterprise → `enterprise-safety` (BLAST_RADIUS + ROLLBACK). Conflicts → `skill-router`.

## Git hygiene

No secrets in commits. No amend of pushed commits / no force-push `main`|`master` without explicit force confirm. Prefer new commits. Details: `/ship`.

## No-edit gates

No drive-by app/CI/deploy/lockfile edits when:

- `/plan` draft|list — only `<workspace>/.cursor/plans/*.plan.md`
- `/plan` run — one todo via `/make`|`/fix`; frontmatter status only on that todo
- `/feature` plan turn — only `<workspace>/.cursor/features/*.feature.md`
- `/feature` slice — app edits via `/make`|`/fix` for **one** slice; update that slice status in `.feature.md`
- `/review` · `/upgrades` audit|propose · `/note` list|find

`/upgrades apply` → pack only. Else recommendations until `/make`|`/fix`|`/feature`|`/plan run` + confirm.

## Full vs Lite

- `/fix` = Full (repro → falsify → patch → verify). `/make` = Lite unless `--full` or auto-full (schema, auth, SSoT, secrets/env, prod).
- Unknown cause → `/fix`. Mid-make ambiguity → `/fix` posture. Act, then short REPORT.

## Risk and verify

Before patch: **LOW|MED|HIGH**. HIGH = `enterprise-safety` surfaces, public API breaks, security.  
After patch: IDENTIFY → RUN → READ ([verify-matrix](../templates/ops/verify-matrix.md)). Budget ≤5 files / ≤120 lines unless override + user OK. Short answers; expand on BLOCKED/HIGH.

## Secrets and PII

No secrets/PII in REPORT, notes, commits, fixtures. `/ship` scans diff. `/note` = memory only (not logs/stacks).

## Memory recall (required)

Before substantive `/fix`|`/make`|`/feature`|`/plan` (or non-trivial multi-step chat work):

1. Resolve `PROJECT` (`/note` rules). Emit `MODEL-RUST-PROJECT: <slug>` in the reply.
2. **MUST RUN** `model-rust search --q "<task keywords>" [--project <PROJECT>] --limit 5` and cite `MODEL-RUST: …` or `MODEL-RUST: none`.
3. When project known: also `model-rust note list --project <PROJECT> --limit 3`; cite `NOTES: …` (skip `expired: true`).
4. If binary/`.env` missing → one line `MODEL-RUST: unavailable` — do not fake hits.

Skip search only for pure ack/confirm turns. Notes < code/tests/user.

**Memory split:** `/note` → Mongo `notes`. Hooks → `turns` source=`chat`. Do not paste the same content into both. Conflicts → `skill-router`.
